<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets call warrants on H-shares basket.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets call warrants on H-shares basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wendesday it launched 63 million American-style call warrants on a basket of five Hong Kong-listed H-shares of China-incorporated companies.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Maanshan Iron and Steel Co Ltd	2   shares</p>
<p> Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd	 3   shares</p>
<p> Guangshen Railway Co Ltd		2   shares</p>
<p> Zhenhai Refining &amp; Chemical Co Ltd  1   share</p>
<p> Qingling Motors Co Ltd		  1   share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$18.18	 PREMIUM	 24.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.79	  GEARING	 2.6x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  14.NOV.97	PAYDATE	 12.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  16.DEC.96</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG	EXER LOT	5,000</p>
<p>NOTE: CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT THE DISCRETION OF ISSUER.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
